#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:54, inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:91
msgid "Google address autocomplete"
msgstr "Samodejno dopolnjevanje naslovov v Googlu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:63
msgid "Google Places API version"
msgstr "Različica API-ja Google Places"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:65
msgid ""
"Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving "
"to the new Places API as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, katero različico vmesnika API Google Places želite uporabljati. "
"Priporočamo, da čim prej preidete na novi vmesnik API Places."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:65
msgid ""
"We recommend using \"Places API (New)\" as effective March 1, 2025, Google "
"will move the \"Places API (Legacy)\" version into Legacy status, meaning "
"you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that "
"that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing "
"accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without "
"disruptions."
msgstr ""
"Priporočamo uporabo »Places API (New)«, saj bo Google s 1. marcem 2025 "
"različico »Places API (Legacy)« preklopil v status »Legacy«, kar pomeni, da "
"te storitve ne boste več mogli omogočiti za nove API-ključe in da ta "
"različica API-ja sčasoma ne bo več na voljo. Obstoječi računi, ki že "
"uporabljajo API v statusu »Legacy«, bodo lahko še naprej delovali brez "
"motenj."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:69
msgid "(Recommended)"
msgstr "(Priporočeno)"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:79
msgid "Google API key"
msgstr "Ključ API-ja Google"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:80
msgid ""
"Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for "
"this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, "
"otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from "
"completing their orders."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite svoj ključ API-ja Google in s pomočjo gumba za testiranje "
"preverite, ali deluje na tej spletni strani. Prepričajte se, da je ključ "
"veljaven in dovoljen za vašo domeno, sicer se lahko polje za naslov "
"blokira, kar bo strankam onemogočilo zaključek naročil."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:92
msgid "Enable Google address autocomplete"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno dopolnjevanje naslovov v Googlu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:93
msgid "Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs."
msgstr "Omogočite samodejno dopolnjevanje naslovov z uporabo API-jev Google Maps."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:103
msgid "Google API language"
msgstr "Jezik Google API"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:105
msgid ""
"This language will be used to display the Google Places API address "
"suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language."
msgstr ""
"Ta jezik se bo uporabljal za prikaz predlogov naslovov iz API-ja Google "
"Places, naslovi pa se bodo v tem jeziku tudi samodejno dopolnjevali."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:120
msgid "Result types"
msgstr "Vrste rezultatov"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:122
msgid ""
"Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better "
"matching results. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">See documentation for "
"more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to "
"return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps "
"documentation to learn more about the <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-"
"types\" target=\"_blank\">supported types</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pustite prazno, da se sprejmejo vsi tipi rezultatov, kar ponavadi prinese "
"boljše ujemanje rezultatov. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Za več "
"podrobnosti glejte dokumentacijo</a>. <br>Izberite do 5 vrst rezultatov "
"iskanja naslovov, ki naj se prikažejo v poljih za samodejno dopolnjevanje "
"naslovov. <br>Obiščite dokumentacijo Google Maps, da izveste več o <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-"
"types\" target=\"_blank\">podprtih vrstah</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:139
msgid "Result types (Legacy API)"
msgstr "Vrste rezultatov (stari API)"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:141
msgid ""
"Which type of address search results to return when using Places API "
"(Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to "
"learn more about the <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/"
"supported_types#table3\" target=\"_blank\">supported types</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kateri tip rezultatov iskanja naslovov naj se prikaže pri uporabi vmesnika "
"Places API (Legacy). <br>Oglejte si dokumentacijo stare različice Google "
"Places API, da izveste več o <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/"
"supported_types#table3\" target=\"_blank\">podprtih vrstah</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:156
msgid "Company fields"
msgstr "Polja podjetja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:157
msgid "Enable autocomplete for the company name if available"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno dopolnjevanje imena podjetja, če je na voljo"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:158
msgid ""
"Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name "
"information when returned from the Google Maps APIs."
msgstr ""
"Omogoči samodejno dopolnjevanje polja »podjetje« s podatki o imenu "
"podjetja, ko jih vrnejo vmesniki API storitve Google Maps."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:172
msgid "Business search"
msgstr "Iskanje podjetij"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:173
msgid "Enable search for businesses in the company field"
msgstr "Omogoči iskanje podjetij v polju »Podjetje«"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:174
msgid ""
"Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in "
"the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business "
"is selected from the suggestions."
msgstr ""
"Omogoči prikaz predlogov naslovov, povezanih s podjetjem, med vnašanjem v "
"polje »Podjetje«, nato pa samodejno dopolni vsa polja za naslove, ko je "
"izmed predlogov izbrano podjetje."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:188
msgid "Company result types"
msgstr "Vrste poslovnih rezultatov"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:190
msgid ""
"Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete "
"company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which "
"includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of "
"results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit "
"the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-"
"types\" target=\"_blank\">supported types</a>."
msgstr ""
"Izberite do 5 vrst rezultatov iskanja naslovov, ki naj se prikažejo pri "
"samodejnem dopolnjevanju polj podjetja. <br>Priporočena vrednost je "
"<code>podjetje</code>, ki vključuje večino vrst podjetij. <br>Če polje "
"pustite prazno, se sprejmejo vse vrste rezultatov, vključno z rezultati, ki "
"niso povezani s podjetji. <br>Obiščite dokumentacijo Google Maps, da "
"izveste več o <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-"
"types\" target=\"_blank\">podprtih vrstah</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:207
msgid "Google logo"
msgstr "Logotip Googla"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:208
msgid "Show text and logo \"Powered by Google\""
msgstr "Prikaži besedilo in logotip »Powered by Google«"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:209
msgid ""
"When checked, the text and logo \"Powered by Google\" will be displayed at "
"the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box."
msgstr ""
"Če je ta možnost izbrana, se bosta besedilo in logotip »Powered by Google« "
"prikazala na dnu okna s predlogi za samodejno dopolnjevanje naslova."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:228
msgid "Brasil API address autocomplete"
msgstr "Samodejno dopolnjevanje naslovov v Braziliji prek API-ja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:236
msgid "Brasil API"
msgstr "API za Brazilijo"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:237
msgid "Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno dopolnjevanje naslovov prek API-ja Brasil za polja CEP"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:238
msgid ""
"Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode "
"field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite API Brasil za pridobivanje in samodejno izpolnjevanje naslovov "
"prek polja CEP/poštna številka. Velja le za brazilske naslove."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:248
msgid "API version"
msgstr "Različica API-ja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-autocomplete.php:249
msgid "Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use."
msgstr "Izberite, katero različico metode CEP v API-ju Brasil želite uporabiti."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:65
msgid "Address book migration"
msgstr "Prenos imenika"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:73
msgid "WooCommerce addresses"
msgstr "Naslovi WooCommerce"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:74
msgid ""
"Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the "
"customers' address book."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte obstoječe naslove za dostavo in zaračunavanje iz WooCommerce v "
"imenik naslovov strank."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:120
msgid "Enable the address book feature"
msgstr "Vklopite funkcijo imenika"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:121
msgid ""
"Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address "
"to be used for shipping and billing."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite strankam, da shranijo več naslovov in določijo privzeti naslov, "
"ki se bo uporabljal za dostavo in zaračunavanje."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:130
msgid "Address labels"
msgstr "Nalepke z naslovi"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:131
msgid "Allow customers to add a custom label for each address"
msgstr "Omogočite strankam, da za vsak naslov dodajo lastno oznako"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:132
msgid ""
"Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their "
"saved addresses (ie.: \"Mom's House\"). The address labels are private to "
"the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details "
"page or invoices."
msgstr ""
"Oznake naslovov strankam olajšajo razlikovanje med shranjenimi naslovi "
"(npr.: »Mamin dom«). Oznake naslovov so zasebne in se ne prikazujejo niti "
"ne natisnejo na strani s podrobnostmi naročila ali na računih."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:145
msgid "Display layout"
msgstr "Razpored prikaza"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:146
msgid "Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, kako se bodo shranjeni naslovi prikazovali ob zaključku nakupa in "
"v košarici."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:146
msgid ""
"Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page "
"always use the cards layout."
msgstr ""
"Uporablja se ob zaključku nakupa in v košarici. Pri shranjenih naslovih na "
"strani računa se vedno uporablja razporeditev s karticami."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:150
msgid "Address cards"
msgstr "Vizitke"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:151
msgid "Address list"
msgstr "Seznam naslovov"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:152
msgid "Dropdown field"
msgstr "Polje s spustnim menijem"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:164
msgid "Address search"
msgstr "Iskanje naslova"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:166
msgid ""
"Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this "
"number of saved addresses available."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži filter za iskanje naslovov na uporabniškem vmesniku, če ima stranka "
"na voljo vsaj to število shranjenih naslovov."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:166
msgid "Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field."
msgstr "Ne uporablja se, če je razpored zaslona nastavljen na spustno polje."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-address-book.php:170
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Naslovi"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:123
msgid "Enable cart page optimizations to see more options"
msgstr ""
"Omogočite optimizacije strani z nakupovalno košarico, da si ogledate več "
"možnosti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:135
msgid "Sticky order summary"
msgstr "Povzetek naročila, ki ostane na vrhu strani"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:152
msgid ""
"Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. "
"Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are "
"enabled in the WooCommerce settings."
msgstr ""
"Izberite mesto, kjer naj se na strani košarice prikaže razdelek s kodami "
"kuponov. To velja le, če je omogočena košarica AJAX in če je v nastavitvah "
"WooCommerce omogočena uporaba kod kuponov."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:225
msgid "Layout of cross-sell"
msgstr "Shema navzkrižne prodaje"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:244
msgid "Cross-sells displayed"
msgstr "Prikazane dopolnilne prodaje"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:250
msgid "Items"
msgstr "Izdelki"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:282
msgid "Cart page optimization"
msgstr "Optimizacija strani z košarico"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:287
msgid "Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout."
msgstr ""
"Poskrbite, da bo vaš nakupovalni koš imel enako pregledno in na konverzijo "
"usmerjeno postavitev kot vaš postopek plačila."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:289
msgid ""
"Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase "
"journey."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite postavitev košarice strani za zaključek nakupa, da bo nakupna "
"izkušnja dosledna."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:290
msgid ""
"Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when "
"quantities change."
msgstr ""
"Košarico je treba v ozadju vedno posodabljati, pri spremembi količin pa se "
"stran ne sme v celoti ponovno naložiti."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:291
msgid ""
"Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert "
"best."
msgstr ""
"Kode kuponov, informacije o dostavi in dodatne ponudbe umestite točno tja, "
"kjer prinašajo najboljše rezultate."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:292
msgid ""
"Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where "
"shoppers need reassurance."
msgstr ""
"Poskrbite, da bo povzetek naročila viden tudi med pomikanjem po strani, in "
"dodajte simbole zaupanja tam, kjer kupci potrebujejo zagotovilo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:87
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "Stolpci"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:113
msgid ""
"General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. "
"Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Splošni slogi za korake v postopku plačila, povzetek naročila in druge "
"razdelke. Velja za druge strani, kot so stran za plačilo, košarica, stran z "
"zahvalo (naročilo prejeto) in stran za pregled naročila."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:121
msgid ""
"When using the <em>\"1 column\"</em> layout with the <em>\"Split\"</em> "
"design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget "
"area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). "
"Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles."
msgstr ""
"Pri uporabi postavitve <em>»1 stolpec«</em> s predlogo <em>»Split«</em> se "
"desni stolpec prikaže le, če je območje za widgete v stranskem pasu strani "
"aktivno (stranski pas pri plačilu, stranski pas v košarici ali stranski pas "
"ob prejemu naročila). V nasprotnem primeru stran ostane enostolpčna s slogi "
"»Split«."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:138
msgid "Split column background"
msgstr "Razdeljeno ozadje stolpca"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:140
msgid ""
"Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave "
"empty to use the order summary background color."
msgstr ""
"Izberite barvo ozadja za sekundarni stolpec v postavitvi »Split«. Če polje "
"pustite prazno, se bo uporabila barva ozadja povzetka naročila."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:169
msgid "Page templates"
msgstr "Predloge strani"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:176
msgid "Checkout template"
msgstr "Predloga za zaključek nakupa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:178
msgid ""
"Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a "
"href=\"https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment\" target=\"_blank\">Read "
"the research about cart abandonment</a>."
msgstr ""
"Priporočljivo za zmanjšanje motenj ob zaključku nakupa. <a "
"href=\"https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Preberite raziskavo o opustitvi nakupnih košaric</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:271
msgid "Sticky progress bar"
msgstr "Lepilni kazalnik napredka"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:284
msgid "Progress bar style"
msgstr "Slog kazalnika napredka"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:325
msgid "Order totals"
msgstr "Skupni zneski naročil"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:335
msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Barva ozadja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:346
msgid "Action link"
msgstr "Povezava za ukrepanje"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:362
msgid "Mobile order summary"
msgstr "Povzetek mobilnega naročila"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:379
msgid "Mobile initial state"
msgstr "Začetno stanje mobilne naprave"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:417
msgid "Enable editing cart items at checkout"
msgstr "Omogoči urejanje artiklov v košarici ob zaključku nakupa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:418
msgid ""
"Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at "
"the checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite strankam, da na strani za plačilo spremenijo količine izdelkov "
"ali odstranijo izdelke."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:427
msgid "Cart item errors"
msgstr "Napake pri izdelkih v košarici"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:459
msgid ""
"Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the "
"checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the "
"WooCommerce settings."
msgstr ""
"Velja le, če je koda kupona prikazana kot ločen razdelek na straneh za "
"plačilo ali v košarici ter če je uporaba kod kuponov omogočena v "
"nastavitvah WooCommerce."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:467
msgid "Coupon codes position"
msgstr "Mesto za kodice kuponov"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:487
msgid "Apply coupon button"
msgstr "Gumb »Uporabi kupon«"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:489
msgid "Select style of the \"apply coupon\" button."
msgstr "Izberite slog gumba »Uporabi kupon«."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:559
msgid "Address line 2"
msgstr "Naslovna vrstica 2"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:619, inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:164
msgid ""
"This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On "
"the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector "
"shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a "
"separate section (after)."
msgstr ""
"Ta nastavitev velja tako za razdelek »Checkout« kot za razdelek »Lokalni "
"prevzem«. V razdelku »Lokalni prevzem« določa tudi, ali se izbirnik "
"»Pošiljanje/Prevzem« prikaže znotraj razdelka z načini dostave (pred "
"naslovom) ali kot ločen razdelek (za njim)."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:38, inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:332
msgid "Customer accounts"
msgstr "Strankini računi"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:74, inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:81
msgid "Guest checkout"
msgstr "Nakup kot gost"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:76
msgid ""
"Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce "
"Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so "
"you can use different values per settings profile."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti za nakup kot gost, prijavo in ustvarjanje računa na strani "
"nastavitev »Računi« v WooCommerce. Zaradi vaše udobnosti se te možnosti "
"upravljajo tukaj, tako da lahko za vsak profil nastavitev uporabite "
"različne vrednosti."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:82
msgid "Allow customers to checkout without an account"
msgstr "Omogočite strankam, da opravijo nakup brez računa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:83
msgid ""
"<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an "
"account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Priporočeno</strong>, da se od strank med zaključkom nakupa ne "
"zahteva, da ustvarijo račun ali se prijavijo, kar lahko zniža stopnje "
"konverzije."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:83
msgid ""
"When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"Če je ta možnost onemogočena, se morajo stranke prijaviti ali ustvariti "
"račun, da lahko zaključijo nakup."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:91
msgid "Login at checkout"
msgstr "Prijava ob zaključku nakupa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:92
msgid "Enable log-in during checkout"
msgstr "Omogoči prijavo med zaključevanjem naročila"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:93
msgid "Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Na strani za zaključek nakupa prikaži povezavo, prek katere se lahko stalni "
"kupci prijavijo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:101, inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:222
msgid "Account creation"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje računa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:102
msgid "Allow customers to create an account during checkout"
msgstr "Omogočite strankam, da si med zaključevanjem nakupa ustvarijo račun"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:103
msgid "Customers can create an account before placing their order."
msgstr "Stranke lahko pred oddajo naročila ustvarijo račun."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:110
msgid "Allow customers to create an account from the My account page"
msgstr "Omogočite strankam, da si ustvarijo račun na strani »Moj račun«"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:111
msgid "Customers can register a new account from the My account page."
msgstr "Stranke lahko ustvarijo nov račun na strani »Moj račun«."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:118
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:119
msgid "Generate from customer's name"
msgstr "Ustvari na podlagi imena stranke"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:120
msgid ""
"<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a "
"username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Priporočeno</strong>, da se strankam med zaključkom nakupa ne "
"zahteva izbira uporabniškega imena, kar lahko zniža stopnje konverzije."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:120
msgid ""
"A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address "
"when a name cannot be used."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime se ustvari na podlagi imena stranke ali, če imena ni mogoče "
"uporabiti, na podlagi e-poštnega naslova."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:131
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Geslo"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:132
msgid "Send password setup link"
msgstr "Pošlji povezavo za nastavitev gesla"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:133
msgid ""
"<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password "
"during checkout, which can lower conversion rates."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Priporočeno</strong>, da se od strank med zaključevanjem nakupa ne "
"zahteva nastavitev gesla, kar lahko zniža stopnjo konverzije."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:133
msgid "Customers receive an email to create their password securely."
msgstr ""
"Stranke prejmejo e-poštno sporočilo, v katerem lahko varno ustvarijo svoje "
"geslo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:154
msgid ""
"Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate "
"the order with their existing account when contact details match."
msgstr ""
"Registriranim strankam omogočite, da zaključijo nakup brez prijave, "
"naročilo pa se poveže z njihovim obstoječim računom, če se kontaktni "
"podatki ujemajo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:171
msgid "Existing account message"
msgstr "Sporočilo o obstoječem računu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:196
msgid ""
"Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank "
"you page."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite strankam, da si po oddaji naročila ustvarijo račun na strani z "
"zahvalo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:203, inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:213
msgid ""
"Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account "
"matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed "
"account creation."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti v tem razdelku so na voljo, če sta omogočena plačilo kot gost in "
"usklajevanje računov. Omogočite obe zgoraj navedeni funkciji, da nastavite "
"odloženo ustvarjanje računa."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:223
msgid "Enable delayed account creation"
msgstr "Omogoči odloženo ustvarjanje računa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:224
msgid ""
"Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account "
"matching are enabled."
msgstr ""
"Omogoči odloženo ustvarjanje računa, kadar sta omogočena tako nakup kot "
"gost kot tudi usklajevanje računov."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:238
msgid "Section position"
msgstr "Položaj oddelka"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:244
msgid "Before customer details section"
msgstr "Pred razdelkom s podatki o stranki"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:245
msgid "After customer details section"
msgstr "Po razdelku s podatki o stranki"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:259
msgid "Account creation benefits"
msgstr "Prednosti ustvarjanja računa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-customer-accounts.php:260
msgid "Leaving the field empty will display the default text."
msgstr "Če polje pustite prazno, se bo prikazalo privzeto besedilo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-express-checkout.php:84
msgid "Inline buttons"
msgstr "Gumbi v besedilu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-express-checkout.php:98
msgid "Required fields"
msgstr "Obvezna polja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-gift-options.php:73
msgid "Enable gift message fields at checkout"
msgstr "Omogoči polja za sporočilo ob darilu ob zaključku nakupa"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-gift-options.php:83
msgid "Expanded gift message"
msgstr "Podrobnejše sporočilo ob darilu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-gift-options.php:84
msgid "Display gift message field always expanded"
msgstr "Polje za vnos darilnega sporočila naj bo vedno razširjeno"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-gift-options.php:97
msgid "Gift message in order details"
msgstr "Sporočilo ob darilu v podrobnostih naročila"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-integrations.php:97
msgid ""
"No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options "
"related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or "
"theme is activated."
msgstr ""
"V tem razdelku trenutno ni na voljo nobenih integracij. Možnosti, povezane "
"z vsakim vtičnikom in temo, se bodo tukaj prikazale šele, ko bo zadevni "
"vtičnik ali tema aktiviran/-a."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:38, inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:335
msgid "Phone fields"
msgstr "Polja za telefonske številke"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:73, inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:120, inc/admin/admin-settings-vat-assistant.php:121
msgid "Field visibility"
msgstr "Vidljivost na terenu"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:88, inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:135
msgid "Field position"
msgstr "Položaj na igrišču"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:160
msgid "Phone country code & validation"
msgstr "Koda države za telefonske številke in preverjanje veljavnosti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:169
msgid "Country"
msgstr "Država"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:170
msgid "Enable country on phone fields"
msgstr "Omogoči izbiro države v poljih za telefon"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:193
msgid "Filter countries for shipping or billing"
msgstr "Filtriranje držav za dostavo ali zaračunavanje"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:194
msgid ""
"Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for "
"shipping or billing on your store."
msgstr ""
"Izbirnik države v vsakem polju za telefonsko številko omejite na države, ki "
"so v vaši trgovini dovoljene za dostavo ali zaračunavanje."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:208
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "Preverjanje veljavnosti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:209
msgid "Enable simple validation based on country rules"
msgstr "Omogoči preprosto preverjanje veljavnosti na podlagi pravil posameznih držav"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:210
msgid ""
"Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including "
"country code and length."
msgstr ""
"Preveri, ali je telefonska številka veljavna za izbrano državo, vključno z "
"državno kodo in številom mest."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:224
msgid ""
"Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other "
"accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers."
msgstr ""
"Strožji pregled, ali je številka veljavna mobilna, fiksna ali druga vrsta "
"številke, ki je sprejemljiva za izbrano državo. Lahko se zavrnejo nekatere "
"veljavne številke."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:237
msgid "Validation types"
msgstr "Vrste validacije"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-international-phone.php:259
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "Zamenljivki"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-license-keys.php:66
msgid ""
"No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when "
"a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno ni nobenih licenčnih ključev za upravljanje. Licenčni ključi se "
"bodo tukaj prikazali, ko bo aktiven licenciran vtičnik ali dodatek Fluid "
"Checkout."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:92
msgid "Default delivery type"
msgstr "Privzeti način dostave"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:94
msgid "Choose which delivery type will be selected by default."
msgstr "Izberite, kateri način dostave bo privzeto izbran."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:112
msgid "Shipping zone fields"
msgstr "Polja za poštne območja"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:113
msgid ""
"Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone "
"filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, katera polja se bodo prikazovala v filtrih za območja dostave pri "
"prevzemu na kraju samem. Če polje pustite prazno, se prikažejo vse "
"razpoložljive možnosti."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:114
msgid ""
"These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping "
"methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, "
"if compatible plugins require them to work properly."
msgstr ""
"Ta polja se bodo prikazala kot filter za načine dostave z lokalnim "
"prevzemom. Nekatera polja se lahko kljub temu prikažejo ob zaključku "
"naročila, čeprav tukaj niso izbrana, če jih združljivi vtičniki potrebujejo "
"za pravilno delovanje."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-local-pickup.php:130
msgid "Order shipping address"
msgstr "Naslov za dostavo naročila"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:55
msgid "Order pay page optimization"
msgstr "Optimizacija strani za plačilo naročila"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:60
msgid "Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout."
msgstr ""
"Neplačanim naročilom dodelite enako pregledno in na konverzijo usmerjeno "
"postavitev kot pri zaključku nakupa."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:62
msgid "Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment."
msgstr ""
"Optimizirajte postavitev strani za plačilo naročil, za katera je plačilo še "
"v teku."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:63
msgid ""
"Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase "
"journey."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite izkušnjo plačila naročila svojemu postopku plačila, da "
"zagotovite dosledno nakupno izkušnjo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:64
msgid "Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte simbole zaupanja in oznake tam, kjer kupci pred plačilom "
"potrebujejo zagotovilo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:55
msgid "Thank you page optimization"
msgstr "Optimizacija strani z zahvalo"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:60
msgid ""
"Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they "
"buy."
msgstr ""
"Stran z zahvalo in podrobnosti o naročilu morajo biti za stranke po nakupu "
"bolj jasne."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:62
msgid "Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout."
msgstr ""
"Optimizirajte stran z zahvalo in podrobnosti o naročilu na računu z "
"jasnejšo postavitvijo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:63
msgid ""
"Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make "
"sense."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži napredek stanja naročila, ukrepe, prenose in opombe tam, kjer je to "
"primerno."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:64
msgid "Customize order details sections on email notifications."
msgstr "Prilagodite razdelke s podrobnostmi naročila v e-poštnih obvestilih."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:65
msgid "Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte simbole zaupanja in značke tam, kjer kupci po nakupu potrebujejo "
"zagotovilo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:122
msgid "Email notifications"
msgstr "Obvestila po e-pošti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:164, inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:233
msgid "Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options"
msgstr ""
"Omogočite optimizacijo strani z zahvalo in podrobnosti naročila, da si "
"ogledate več možnosti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:192
msgid "Use wide layout on thank you page"
msgstr "Na strani z zahvalo uporabite široko postavitev"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-received.php:223
msgid ""
"These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account "
"pages and on email notifications."
msgstr ""
"Te nastavitve vplivajo na stran z zahvalo, prikaz podrobnosti naročila na "
"straneh računa ter na e-poštna obvestila."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:255, inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:720, inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:857
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Shrani nastavitve"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:305
msgid "Docs"
msgstr "Dokumenti"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:325, inc/admin/admin-settings-preview.php:94, inc/admin/admin-settings-trust-symbols.php:104
msgid "Cart"
msgstr "Košarica"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:326, inc/admin/admin-settings-preview.php:100, inc/admin/admin-settings-trust-symbols.php:136
msgid "Thank you"
msgstr "Hvala"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-page.php:329
