#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:301
msgid ""
"Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the "
"current user's data, or pass user_id to target another account when the "
"caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests "
"return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found."
msgstr ""
"Za pošiljanje zahtevkov se zahteva, da je uporabnik prijavljen v WordPress. "
"Če želite uporabiti podatke trenutnega uporabnika, izpustite parameter "
"user_id; če pa želite nasloviti drug račun, vnesite user_id, če ima "
"klicatelj pravico do urejanja tega uporabnika (pristojnost edit_user). "
"Neavtentificirani zahtevki vrnejo napako fc_api_forbidden. Neveljaven "
"user_id vrne napako fc_api_user_not_found."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:316
msgid "HTTP 200 with { \"data\": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload."
msgstr "HTTP 200 z { \"data\": { ... } }, ko obdelovalnik vrne vsebino."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:317
msgid ""
"HTTP 200 with { \"success\": true } when there is no payload (for example "
"DELETE)."
msgstr "HTTP 200 z { \"success\": true }, kadar ni vsebine (na primer pri DELETE)."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:318
msgid ""
"Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, "
"data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix."
msgstr ""
"Napake vrnejo JSON-odziv z napako WordPress REST iz razreda WP_Error (koda, "
"sporočilo, data.status). Kode v omrežju uporabljajo predpono fc_api_*."

